  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.29 Single-ply roof membrane installation and repair adhesive",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.29 “Single-ply roof membrane installation and repair adhesive” means any adhesive labeled for use for attaching the edge of a membrane to the edge of a roof, applying or reapplying flashings to vents, pipes, and ducts that protrude through a membrane, repairing single-ply roof membrane, gluing the edges of torn membrane together or attaching a patch over a hole in a membrane.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
}
